  "summary": "Accomplished professional with over a decade of experience in design, implementation, and delivery of innovative solutions in communication systems. \n\nProficient in multiple programming languages such as C++, Python, and Bash scripting, with expertise in embedded software, including Board Support Packages (BSP) and Linux Kernel Drivers. \n\nSkilled in testing and troubleshooting, hardware bring-up, system testing, and debugging methodologies. Solid track record leading high-performing teams and collaborating cross functionally to achieve project goals. \n\nAdaptable and efficient problem solver with active DoD security clearance and strong focus on delivering high-performance and reliable solutions that meet technical requirements and end-user needs in dynamic environments. Fully bilingual in English and Spanish.",
