    "description": "Led a team of 7 engineers in the design, implementation, integration, and release of embedded application software for complex communication systems, incorporating both low-level and networked components.\n\nArchitected and implemented complex features using low-level interfaces, including PID tuning, real-\ntime coordination across networked modules and interactions between user level and RTOS interfaces.\n\nDeveloped multi-threaded applications using modern C++ features and QT framework.\n\nAchieved subject matter expertise across multiple programs and baselines, serving as a key technical\nresource.\n\nMentored junior engineers to facilitate program ramp-up and accelerate productivity.\n\nDesigned and implemented automation scripts to streamline testing and troubleshooting, significantly\nimproving problem resolution efficiency.\n\nSupported new system development by implementing low-level drivers and new application features based on legacy system architectures.\n\nImplemented Linux kernel drivers for several modules across legacy and modern baselines.\n\nDesigned application-layer software to interface with kernel drivers, fulfilling high-level system\nrequirements for a complex satellite communication ground station.\n\nSupported development of operator console GUI applications for system command and control.\n\nPerformed cross-functional reviews to support integration and testing of hardware modules.\n\nCollaborated across firmware and electrical disciplines to detect and correct issues, expediting integration efforts.",
